  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">You can pull creatures readily across planes. When you use Manifesting Touch, you can cast a summon spell by the end of your next turn with 1 fewer action (minimum 1). Add the following to the trigger or requirements listed for @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.bCLBiXDx5A3UmVNE]{Manifesting Touch}.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Trigger </strong>You used an action, spell, or ability to dismiss or end a summon spell.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Requirements</strong> An action, spell, or ability used to end your summon spell did not involve reducing them to 0 hit points or killing them.</p>"
